Spinnaker 1.25.4 service images (archive)

What these are
  The service images of Spinnaker release 1.25.4 (clouddriver, front50, gate, orca, rosco),
  linux/amd64, exactly as upstream built them. Nothing was rebuilt, patched or modified: each
  image's configuration (its image ID) and every layer are byte for byte those of the archive
  they were taken from. The only new thing is the registry packaging: an OCI manifest that
  lists the original layers (uncompressed, as in the archive) and the original configuration,
  built by scripts/push-spinnaker.py (annotations carry the original reference and image ID).

Where and when they were obtained
  Saved from us-docker.pkg.dev/spinnaker-community/docker/<service>:<tag> into the bundle
  cache of an earlier test harness (that cache's manifest.json is dated 2026-07-24T03:57:50Z;
  the registry digests were not recorded there). The five archives are pinned by file sha256
  in images/spinnaker/1.25.4/inputs.env. On 2026-11-14 the tags no longer resolved at
  us-docker.pkg.dev or gcr.io/spinnaker-marketplace (HTTP 404 MANIFEST_UNKNOWN; see
